      en: ["The delta covers an area of approximately 180,000 hectares.", "It was inscribed as a UNESCO World Heritage site in 2011.", "There are over 218 man-made shellfish mounds in the area.", "More than 200 islands make up the intricate system of the delta.", "The waters are home to over 100 different species of fish.", "It serves as a critical resting point for thousands of migratory birds."],
      es: ["Reserva de la biosfera en el suroeste de Senegal", "Unos 180.000 hectáreas", "Desembocaduras del Sine y el Saloum", "Los manglares definen el espacio paisajístico", "Las colinas de conchas atestiguan una larga ocupación", "Las piraguas son el medio de transporte más importante", "La pesca y la recolección son centrales"],
      pt: ["Reserva da biosfera no sudoeste do Senegal", "Cerca de 180.000 hectares", "Fozes do Sine e do Saloum", "Os mangais definem o espaço paisagístico", "Os montes de conchas atestam uma longa ocupação", "As pirogas são o meio de transporte mais importante", "A pesca e a recoleção são centrais"],
