      en: ["The island is only about 900 meters long and 350 meters wide.", "It was inscribed on the UNESCO World Heritage list in 1978.", "There is no private car traffic permitted on the entire island.", "The famous House of Slaves was constructed in the year 1776.", "Portuguese navigators first reached the island in the year 1444.", "Gorée is located just a 20-minute ferry ride from Dakar."],
